    <string name="appIntro">
        PDF STUDIO is a powerful all-in-one document solution designed
        to simplify your workflow. Seamlessly create, compress,
        merge, and edit PDFs, while also supporting Word, PowerPoint,
        and multiple image formats for effortless conversion and management.
