    <string name="privacy_policy_html">
            <![CDATA[
            <h2>Privacy Policy</h2>
            <p><b>Effective Date:</b> [24 APR, 2026]</p>
            </br>
             </br>
              </br>

            <p>Thank you for using <b>PDF Studio</b>. Your privacy is important to us. This Privacy Policy explains how we handle your information when you use our application.</p>

            <h3>1. Information We Collect</h3>
            <p>We do not collect any personally identifiable information from users.</p>
            <ul>
            <li>No account registration required</li>
            <li>No personal data such as name, email, or phone number is collected</li>
            </ul>

            <p>The app may request access to:</p>
            <ul>
            <li><b>Storage (Files & Media):</b> To read, create, edit, merge, and manage PDF files, Word documents, PowerPoint presentations, and images on your device.</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>2. How We Use Your Information</h3>
            <p>All file processing is done locally on your device.</p>
            <ul>
            <li>Create and edit PDF files</li>
            <li>Compress, merge, and manage documents</li>
            <li>Convert Word, PowerPoint, and image files</li>
            </ul>

            <p>We do <b>not upload your files</b> to any server.</p>

            <h3>3. Data Sharing and Third Parties</h3>
            <p>We do not sell, trade, or share your data with third parties.</p>
            <ul>
            <li>No data leaves your device</li>
            <li>No tracking or hidden collection</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>4. Data Security</h3>
            <ul>
            <li>All processing happens on-device</li>
            <li>No external storage of files</li>
            <li>No unauthorized access</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>5. Permissions</h3>
            <p>The app may request:</p>
            <ul>
            <li><b>Storage Permission:</b> Required for document access and editing</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>6. Children’s Privacy</h3>
            <p>This app is not intended for children under 13. We do not knowingly collect data from children.</p>

            <h3>7. Changes to This Policy</h3>
            <p>We may update this policy from time to time. Changes will be reflected on this page.</p>

            <h3>8. Contact Us</h3>
            <p>If you have questions, contact us at:</p>
            <p><b>Email:</b> <a href="">pdfstudio011@gmail.com</a></p>

            <h3>9. Consent</h3>
            <p>By using this app, you agree to this Privacy Policy.</p>
            ]]>
</string>
